# Outgoing mail (verification, password reset, invites, billing reminders).
# Either SMTP — e.g. the Gmail account above with an App Password
# (Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords) — or
# Resend. SMTP wins when both are set; with neither, emails log to the console.
